WEBVTT

01:30.270 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.380 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 40]

01:39.710 --> 01:40.789
Dear guests,

01:41.150 --> 01:42.560
greetings.

01:43.920 --> 01:45.979
The Li family's Sihe Ink you restored

01:46.070 --> 01:47.280
shows exquisite craftsmanship,

01:47.280 --> 01:49.240
comparable to what
the Li family's ancestors made,

01:49.240 --> 01:51.580
revealing the Kuroda family's
extraordinary ink-making skill.

01:51.580 --> 01:53.670
I am very impressed.

01:55.350 --> 01:56.200
However,

01:56.509 --> 01:59.430
this Sihe Ink is a treasure
made by the Li family's ancestors

01:59.430 --> 02:01.640
during the Southern Tang Dynasty.

02:02.040 --> 02:03.300
Since the Southern Tang Dynasty,

02:03.300 --> 02:06.950
the Li family's ink has been refined
by later generations for hundreds of years

02:06.950 --> 02:08.750
and flourished multiple times.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.750
But you've still been studying

02:11.910 --> 02:13.240
the ink-making techniques of our ancestors

02:13.240 --> 02:15.240
from hundreds of years ago.

02:15.910 --> 02:17.470
I think I don't need to say more

02:17.470 --> 02:20.280
about the gap between them.

02:22.740 --> 02:26.400
The guests have come from afar
and must be tired from the long journey.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.800
As for the participation

02:28.150 --> 02:31.000
in the election,
let's discuss it after you settle down.

02:31.000 --> 02:31.800
Servants,

02:33.190 --> 02:36.630
escort the guests
to the post house to take a rest.

02:37.150 --> 02:41.310
Escort the Japanese guests
to the post house to rest.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.230
We'll take our leave.

03:04.910 --> 03:07.640
I, Li Zhen, pay my respects to you,
Your Highness.

03:07.660 --> 03:08.350
Li Zhen,

03:09.750 --> 03:11.560
do you have confidence in beating

03:11.560 --> 03:13.620
the Kuroda family in the ink contest?

03:14.190 --> 03:16.790
I wouldn't dare
to deceive you, Your Highness.

03:16.800 --> 03:19.030
The ink item
the Kuroda family brought today

03:19.030 --> 03:20.760
is indeed a long-lost treasure

03:20.840 --> 03:22.370
of Huizhou Li Ink Workshop.

03:23.520 --> 03:24.240
Nowadays,

03:24.630 --> 03:25.750
not only Li Ink,

03:26.030 --> 03:27.840
but even every workshop in Huizhou

03:27.840 --> 03:28.970
is no match for them,

03:29.280 --> 03:30.430
I'm afraid.

03:31.590 --> 03:32.680
Are you saying

03:33.800 --> 03:35.360
our Great Ming

03:36.520 --> 03:38.050
can't win this ink contest?

03:38.820 --> 03:40.520
If the contest were held today,

03:40.520 --> 03:42.430
Li Ink would have to admit defeat.

03:43.030 --> 03:46.000
But there's still some time
before the Tribute Ink selection.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.400
It's still anyone's game

03:47.630 --> 03:50.630
until the very end.

03:51.360 --> 03:53.360
This is the aura
that the Head of the Workshop

03:53.360 --> 03:54.960
leading Hui Ink should have.

03:56.240 --> 03:57.910
Prefect He has arrived!

04:07.880 --> 04:10.630
I, Luo Wenqian, pay my respects to you,
Your Highness.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.630
Your Highness,

04:12.280 --> 04:14.210
we've got a letter from General Yu.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.760
You may rise.

04:32.950 --> 04:34.409
Thank you, Your Highness.

04:35.920 --> 04:36.780
Your Highness,

04:37.720 --> 04:39.790
as our state
has lifted the ban on maritime trade,

04:39.790 --> 04:43.270
merchant ships can sail from Yue Port
to the East and West Oceans.

04:43.270 --> 04:45.870
Wherever they go,
trade and business prosper.

04:45.920 --> 04:49.240
This time, only Japan was excluded
from the lifting of the ban.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.360
General Yu found out that

04:50.360 --> 04:53.720
the Japanese Kuroda family uses
the exchange of ink-making as an excuse

04:53.720 --> 04:55.630
to participate
in the Tribute Ink selection this time.

04:55.630 --> 04:58.600
Once they win,
they will ask our Great Ming

04:58.630 --> 05:00.870
to grant their family trading rights

05:00.870 --> 05:02.070
at the Yue Port.

05:02.680 --> 05:04.800
This matter involves national policy.

05:04.800 --> 05:07.800
Hence, he sent this letter to alert you,
Your Highness,

05:07.800 --> 05:09.680
to pay more attention to it.

05:09.920 --> 05:10.650
In addition,

05:10.870 --> 05:13.510
the Kuroda family has always
colluded with the Japanese pirates.

05:13.510 --> 05:17.190
General Yu is worried that the pirates
might take the chance to cause trouble,

05:17.190 --> 05:19.390
so he specifically sent me here
for reinforcements,

05:19.390 --> 05:20.850
just to take precautions.

05:23.270 --> 05:27.270
My brother let the Kurodas participate
in the Tribute Ink selection this time

05:27.270 --> 05:30.130
originally for the exchange
of ink-making skills.

05:30.480 --> 05:33.920
We didn't expect the Kuroda family
to be up to something else.

05:37.630 --> 05:38.360
Li Zhen,

05:38.870 --> 05:40.510
if what General Yu said is true,

05:40.510 --> 05:41.630
in this contest,

05:41.830 --> 05:44.600
Hui Ink must emerge victorious.
Failure is not an option.

05:44.600 --> 05:46.920
It concerns our Great Ming's
national maritime opening-up policy.

05:46.920 --> 05:47.980
Do you understand?

05:49.510 --> 05:50.430
Your Highness,

05:50.830 --> 05:52.960
the Kuroda family came here this time,

05:53.240 --> 05:54.560
claiming

05:54.680 --> 05:57.070
that they learned from the ink
made by the Li family's ancestors.

05:57.070 --> 05:57.950
But now,

05:58.159 --> 06:01.000
they're using our family's long-lost ink
to provoke us.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.630
Whether for the family or the state,

06:02.630 --> 06:05.830
the Li family will not hesitate
to sacrifice everything.

06:06.190 --> 06:07.390
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

06:07.390 --> 06:09.560
Li Ink will do its utmost

06:09.750 --> 06:13.480
to give His Majesty and you,
Your Highness, a satisfactory answer.

06:14.720 --> 06:15.600
Good.

06:16.630 --> 06:18.070
Then I will

06:18.510 --> 06:20.120
wait and see.

06:26.430 --> 06:28.920
There were so many people
and so many things going on that night.

06:28.920 --> 06:31.380
I didn't get a chance
to talk to you properly.

06:32.630 --> 06:33.390
Now that

06:33.430 --> 06:35.760
you've returned to General Yu's command,

06:36.390 --> 06:38.830
you finally have
your long-cherished wish fulfilled.

06:38.830 --> 06:39.890
Congratulations.

06:41.070 --> 06:43.430
I dare not have
any more long-cherished wishes.

06:43.430 --> 06:45.030
I'm only repaying the favor.

06:45.870 --> 06:46.950
For General Yu

06:48.310 --> 06:49.040
and for you,

06:50.120 --> 06:51.180
I'm doing the same.

06:54.120 --> 06:56.120
Do you have any plans for the future?

06:58.680 --> 07:00.480
I'm here on the General's orders

07:01.120 --> 07:04.560
to guard against Japanese pirates
before the Tribute Ink selection.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.510
Besides,
both professionally and privately,

07:06.510 --> 07:07.750
I should assist you

07:08.360 --> 07:10.560
to help Li Ink through this crisis.

07:11.070 --> 07:13.240
So if you need anything from now on,

07:13.390 --> 07:14.750
just let me know.

07:16.120 --> 07:19.190
As for the future, I...

07:20.680 --> 07:23.160
The Japanese pirates
haven't been subdued yet.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.560
Be careful and stay safe.

07:26.800 --> 07:27.510
I know.

07:37.240 --> 07:38.370
Where are you going?

07:39.810 --> 07:40.980
I'm going that way.

07:42.170 --> 07:42.930
Well,

07:43.540 --> 07:44.470
I'll go this way.

08:08.500 --> 08:11.070
[Elegant Ink Hall]

08:11.090 --> 08:15.230
[Sihe House]

08:37.360 --> 08:43.120
[Yihousheng]

08:59.240 --> 08:59.840
Sister.

09:04.750 --> 09:06.000
Greetings, Sister.

09:07.550 --> 09:08.440
Wenqian!

09:09.320 --> 09:11.000
You are finally back!

09:12.480 --> 09:13.870
Let me take a look at you.

09:17.510 --> 09:18.710
You haven't changed.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.600
You haven't changed at all,

09:20.600 --> 09:22.930
still as impressive and handsome as ever.

09:23.960 --> 09:26.710
I am so happy to see you.

09:29.550 --> 09:32.430
Come on, take a look around.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.550
Ever since you left,

09:35.600 --> 09:37.670
I haven't changed a single thing

09:37.720 --> 09:39.960
in Yihousheng—

09:40.000 --> 09:41.750
not inside or outside.

09:41.960 --> 09:43.820
I was waiting for you to come back.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.630
Now that you're back,

09:45.910 --> 09:48.790
it's time to return Yihousheng
to its owner.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.080
Sister,

09:52.200 --> 09:54.550
although Yihousheng hasn't changed,

09:56.030 --> 09:57.440
to me,

09:57.790 --> 09:59.790
it feels like a lifetime has passed.

10:00.240 --> 10:02.030
So please don't return it to me.

10:02.670 --> 10:05.120
It is just perfect for you, Sister,

10:05.200 --> 10:06.960
to run Yihousheng.

10:07.510 --> 10:08.200
Alright.

10:08.850 --> 10:10.020
I will listen to you.

10:10.910 --> 10:12.040
Come and take a seat.

10:18.510 --> 10:20.240
Here, have some tea.

10:21.550 --> 10:22.610
Thank you, Sister.

10:31.390 --> 10:32.190
What's wrong?

10:33.960 --> 10:34.630
Wenqian,

10:35.440 --> 10:38.670
although you've been
fighting enemies on the battlefield,

10:38.670 --> 10:39.840
do you know

10:40.080 --> 10:42.210
that you carry less bloodthirsty aura

10:42.240 --> 10:43.840
than you did 3 years ago?

10:46.240 --> 10:47.040
I've grown up.

10:47.400 --> 10:49.200
You really know me well, Sister.

10:51.550 --> 10:53.680
Why didn't Jixiang come back with you?

10:55.440 --> 10:57.120
The General was short-handed,

10:57.120 --> 10:59.240
so I left him with the General.

11:01.000 --> 11:01.750
That's good.

11:02.600 --> 11:05.000
So what are your plans
now that you're back?

11:06.550 --> 11:09.870
The General asked me to secretly
keep an eye on the Kuroda family.

11:09.870 --> 11:12.480
I will fulfill
the General's entrustment first,

11:12.480 --> 11:15.870
and then repair
our Luo family's ancestral hall

11:16.600 --> 11:19.260
and place
my family's memorial tablets inside.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.750
Have you seen your aunt?

11:26.270 --> 11:27.360
My aunt

11:27.960 --> 11:29.290
cried for quite a while,

11:29.550 --> 11:30.750
but she told me,

11:31.390 --> 11:32.150
"Wenqian,

11:33.030 --> 11:34.080
in this world,

11:34.870 --> 11:36.670
there is no longer Luo Mengzhen,

11:37.000 --> 11:38.400
but only Ugly Granny Li."

11:38.910 --> 11:40.440
Fate is so cruel.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.240
The dead are gone,

11:44.480 --> 11:46.610
but the living struggle to find peace.

11:46.910 --> 11:48.240
It is true for your aunt,

11:48.720 --> 11:50.780
and isn't it the same for you and Zhen?

11:51.600 --> 11:52.800
Over the past 3 years,

11:53.390 --> 11:54.790
every time you wrote,

11:55.030 --> 11:57.510
every line was filled
with concern for Zhen.

11:58.440 --> 11:59.600
I think

11:59.910 --> 12:01.710
Zhen is not the kind of girl who is

12:02.000 --> 12:04.270
easily trapped by worldly prejudices.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.270
Since you can't let her go,

12:06.270 --> 12:07.960
and you are now in the clear,

12:08.360 --> 12:10.360
why don't you just say it outright,

12:10.360 --> 12:12.290
court her openly, and win her back?

12:14.120 --> 12:14.910
Sister,

12:16.480 --> 12:18.010
actually, I have seen Zhen.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.360
I knew when I came back this time,
I would definitely see her.

12:21.360 --> 12:23.080
So I prepared a lot of things

12:23.080 --> 12:24.280
I wanted to say to her.

12:25.030 --> 12:26.360
But at the very moment,

12:28.480 --> 12:30.340
I just couldn't say a single word.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.750
Our Luo family

12:33.150 --> 12:34.320
and the Li family...

12:38.720 --> 12:40.360
Now, I only wish I could

12:41.720 --> 12:43.550
protect her by her side

12:44.670 --> 12:46.470
and keep her safe for a lifetime.

12:46.670 --> 12:48.000
That'd be enough for me.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.640
I dare not ask for anything else.

12:56.630 --> 12:57.830
It's hot. Be careful.

12:59.240 --> 13:00.720
It's ready. Come on.

13:06.750 --> 13:07.550
Grandfather.

13:24.120 --> 13:24.870
Redo it.

13:27.120 --> 13:28.050
Let's try again.

13:32.150 --> 13:32.950
Grandfather.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.360
Take a break.

13:36.480 --> 13:37.120
No rush.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.910
Let's take a rest and try again later.

13:39.910 --> 13:42.360
We've tried so many times.

13:43.480 --> 13:45.750
Why can't I master

13:45.750 --> 13:49.120
the precise method
of making the Sihe Ink's lampblack?

13:49.910 --> 13:50.550
I just...

13:51.390 --> 13:52.440
I really...

13:53.000 --> 13:53.930
Uncle Jingdong!

13:54.030 --> 13:54.870
Jingdong.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.640
Why are you laughing?

14:11.150 --> 14:12.840
Don't you guys find it weird?

14:13.460 --> 14:15.440
The Sihe Ink brought by the Kuroda family

14:15.440 --> 14:17.080
is almost identical

14:17.720 --> 14:20.250
to our Li family's Sihe Ink,
whether in luster

14:20.600 --> 14:21.960
or oiliness.

14:22.910 --> 14:24.840
It is strange, indeed.

14:25.360 --> 14:29.080
The Sihe Ink our Li family holds has
a history of at least hundreds of years.

14:29.080 --> 14:31.720
But the Kuroda family's Sihe Ink is new!

14:32.110 --> 14:34.000
It's no more than 10 years old, I guess?

14:34.000 --> 14:36.260
Even if they are both of supreme quality,

14:36.480 --> 14:37.240
there should

14:37.240 --> 14:39.440
still be an obvious difference!

14:40.000 --> 14:42.000
I once heard from an ink merchant

14:42.480 --> 14:45.030
that Japan has
an extremely low production of ink,

14:45.030 --> 14:47.240
so it's much easier for them
to find thousand-year-old pine timber

14:47.240 --> 14:48.630
than it is for us.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.390
So I think

14:51.510 --> 14:54.480
the problem might lie in the pine timber.

15:00.030 --> 15:01.120
No wonder.

15:02.910 --> 15:04.440
The Li family Sihe Ink was

15:04.910 --> 15:07.370
made by our ancestors
hundreds of years ago.

15:08.200 --> 15:11.660
Back then, they made ink
by burning pine timber for lampblack.

15:11.840 --> 15:13.570
There weren't many ink makers.

15:14.120 --> 15:18.200
It was easy to find pine timber hundreds or
even over 1,000 years old in the mountains.

15:18.200 --> 15:19.730
But since the Song Dynasty,

15:20.480 --> 15:22.030
the ink industry has flourished.

15:22.030 --> 15:25.630
The usage of pine timber in Huizhou
has increased gradually.

15:26.320 --> 15:28.450
For the pine timber we're using today,

15:28.510 --> 15:30.710
even the best is less than 100 years old.

15:33.240 --> 15:36.150
Mr. Dongtu once thought of the same thing.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.750
It's exactly because

15:38.930 --> 15:40.370
Hui Ink prospered

15:40.550 --> 15:43.280
that the pine forests
ended up getting depleted.

15:46.360 --> 15:47.390
That explains it.

15:49.000 --> 15:52.030
I thought it was
because of my lack of talent.

15:52.870 --> 15:54.910
I took that slap for nothing.

15:57.030 --> 15:58.320
In this case,

15:58.320 --> 16:00.670
we are not completely at a disadvantage.

16:04.150 --> 16:07.440
The difficulty in finding
thousand-year-old pine timber is one thing.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.630
Even if we have it,

16:08.960 --> 16:10.150
we would just barely

16:11.080 --> 16:12.600
tie with them.

16:12.720 --> 16:14.720
We still stand no chance of winning.

16:16.600 --> 16:17.320
It's fine.

16:17.790 --> 16:18.700
In this case,

16:19.870 --> 16:22.670
let's just surpass our predecessors.

16:25.620 --> 16:29.710
[Chen]

16:41.720 --> 16:44.840
Does the problem
lie in the lampblack or the glue?

16:46.080 --> 16:46.870
Father,

16:47.510 --> 16:48.390
don't worry.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.080
I will go try again.

16:54.000 --> 16:57.000
The day of the Tribute Ink selection is
drawing close.

16:57.150 --> 16:59.120
We still haven't figured out a single way

16:59.120 --> 17:00.750
to compete with the Kuroda family.

17:00.750 --> 17:02.200
How can I not worry?

17:03.200 --> 17:04.069
Indeed.

17:05.109 --> 17:05.829
Father.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.589
If our Chen Ink can't beat them,

17:08.589 --> 17:10.250
there's still Li Ink, Pan Ink,

17:10.349 --> 17:12.510
and ink from Xiuning and Yi County.

17:13.829 --> 17:16.400
The Kuroda family won't succeed.

17:19.000 --> 17:21.800
The Kuroda family has
come in full force this time.

17:23.270 --> 17:24.920
Even we are having a hard time
dealing with them,

17:24.920 --> 17:26.310
let alone the others.

17:28.480 --> 17:29.440
Besides,

17:30.160 --> 17:31.640
the Tribute Ink selection this year

17:31.640 --> 17:34.480
is not just about personal reputation,

17:34.720 --> 17:36.400
but the pride of Hui Ink.

17:38.590 --> 17:41.720
After all, I am one
of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters.

17:41.920 --> 17:44.580
I am supposed to shoulder
this responsibility.

17:45.550 --> 17:46.270
Third Master,

17:46.270 --> 17:47.070
Young Master,

17:47.070 --> 17:49.240
Miss Li Zhen invited you two
to Sibao Restaurant,

17:49.240 --> 17:51.700
asking to discuss
a weighty matter with you.

18:01.510 --> 18:02.440
Elders,

18:03.070 --> 18:05.590
I invited you all here today

18:05.790 --> 18:07.160
to inform you that

18:07.680 --> 18:12.350
Li Ink will make Liuhe (Sixfold Mixing) Ink
to challenge the Kuroda family.

18:12.680 --> 18:13.790
-Liuhe Ink?
-Liuhe Ink?

18:13.790 --> 18:14.640
There's no way!

18:14.640 --> 18:16.110
How is that possible?

18:16.510 --> 18:19.350
Every round of glue-mixing

18:19.960 --> 18:20.920
in ink-making

18:21.920 --> 18:23.720
just adds a level of difficulty.

18:24.200 --> 18:27.310
Sihe (Fourfold Mixing) Ink is
already excellent.

18:27.920 --> 18:30.960
Realizing sixfold mixing
can only be harder.

18:32.070 --> 18:32.960
Manager Zhen.

18:34.590 --> 18:35.590
Eighth Master Li.

18:37.200 --> 18:40.510
How confident are you in making Liuhe Ink?

18:41.920 --> 18:42.880
Elder,

18:43.880 --> 18:46.830
I can't say how confident I am.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.680
But for the Kuroda family's ink,

18:49.880 --> 18:52.210
aside from its exquisite craftsmanship,

18:52.480 --> 18:55.480
it also excels
because of its superior raw materials.

18:55.590 --> 18:57.480
Since it is almost impossible for us

18:57.480 --> 18:59.010
to outdo them on materials,

18:59.350 --> 19:01.200
we must make a kind of ink

19:01.310 --> 19:03.440
that is better than theirs
in craftsmanship.

19:03.440 --> 19:05.700
Only then can we have a chance of winning.

19:05.750 --> 19:07.200
Before this Sihe Ink,

19:07.790 --> 19:09.030
no one ever thought

19:09.270 --> 19:11.610
that ink could be made
with fourfold mixing.

19:11.610 --> 19:12.760
But since our predecessors

19:12.760 --> 19:14.620
could create this Sihe Ink craft,

19:14.720 --> 19:15.480
why can't we,

19:15.480 --> 19:17.550
who are standing on their shoulders,

19:18.000 --> 19:20.510
take things one step further

19:20.550 --> 19:22.200
and try to realize sixfold mixing

19:22.200 --> 19:24.530
to make up for the deficiency in materials

19:24.720 --> 19:27.510
and create an ink that surpasses Sihe Ink,

19:27.590 --> 19:29.440
defeating the Kuroda family?

19:29.680 --> 19:30.790
Well said!

19:37.270 --> 19:38.400
Third Grandfather.

19:38.750 --> 19:39.760
-Girl.
-Welcome.

19:40.590 --> 19:41.590
Well said.

19:42.310 --> 19:43.200
Third Master Chen.

19:43.200 --> 19:44.830
-Uncle Junshan.
-Third Grandfather Chen.

19:44.830 --> 19:46.350
-Third Master Chen.
-Sit down, please.

19:46.350 --> 19:47.950
Everyone, please be seated.

19:48.110 --> 19:49.040
Please sit down.

19:52.310 --> 19:53.350
You heard it all?

19:54.880 --> 19:56.540
Yes, I heard the whole speech.

19:57.720 --> 20:00.790
To go one step further
than our predecessors,

20:01.550 --> 20:02.750
this is a good idea.

20:05.030 --> 20:05.680
Jinshui,

20:05.680 --> 20:07.550
I have never thought you and the Li family

20:07.550 --> 20:09.280
were outdoing me and my family.

20:09.350 --> 20:11.310
But you have
such an excellent granddaughter.

20:11.310 --> 20:13.310
I have to admit it.

20:15.680 --> 20:18.830
Before coming here, I kept thinking

20:20.000 --> 20:22.260
that among all the ink makers in Huizhou,

20:22.270 --> 20:23.720
I am the oldest,

20:24.400 --> 20:26.400
and I must grit my teeth

20:26.510 --> 20:29.920
and shoulder the responsibility
for the younger generations.

20:29.920 --> 20:32.050
But after hearing what this girl said,

20:33.000 --> 20:34.200
I feel that she's

20:35.480 --> 20:36.510
outdoing me.

20:37.550 --> 20:39.010
She's indeed outdoing me.

20:39.350 --> 20:41.280
If Liuhe Ink is successfully made,

20:41.400 --> 20:43.920
it'll truly be a great achievement
combining all the existing techniques

20:43.920 --> 20:47.650
and will surely be a masterpiece
to be handed down for generations.

20:48.270 --> 20:49.160
Jinshui,

20:49.750 --> 20:52.350
Chen Ink will admit defeat this time.

20:54.720 --> 20:55.750
However, girl.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.920
Time is running out.

20:58.070 --> 20:59.720
To make Liuhe Ink is

20:59.750 --> 21:02.010
no longer just the Li family's business.

21:02.070 --> 21:03.550
If you run into any difficulties,

21:03.550 --> 21:05.480
just feel free to tell me

21:05.480 --> 21:06.750
and everyone here.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.240
Third Grandfather,

21:12.240 --> 21:13.700
you came at the right time.

21:13.750 --> 21:16.160
Zhen was just about to ask you
for a favor.

21:17.550 --> 21:19.960
What do you want me to help you with?

21:21.200 --> 21:24.070
To make Liuhe Ink, glue-blending
is of the greatest significance.

21:24.070 --> 21:26.640
I know Uncle Junshan is the best at it.

21:26.830 --> 21:30.070
So, I would like to borrow him from you.

21:30.720 --> 21:34.310
To blend glue, he has to enter
your Li family's ink-mixing area.

21:34.550 --> 21:37.920
Aren't you afraid our Chen family
might steal your techniques?

21:37.920 --> 21:40.400
Third Grandfather, you are joking again.

21:42.110 --> 21:43.880
I want to make this Liuhe Ink, which also

21:43.880 --> 21:47.550
carries the meaning of harmony
between heaven, earth, and people.

21:47.550 --> 21:50.270
Today, I invited all the elders here

21:50.640 --> 21:52.110
not only to inform everyone

21:52.110 --> 21:54.480
that the Li family
will try to make this Liuhe Ink

21:54.480 --> 21:57.400
but also to ask for everyone's assistance.

21:57.830 --> 21:59.230
Let's unite all families

21:59.270 --> 22:00.830
and make this Liuhe Ink.

22:01.110 --> 22:04.000
Harmony between heaven, earth, and people.

22:04.240 --> 22:06.200
This line is a good omen.

22:07.440 --> 22:08.200
Junshan,

22:08.310 --> 22:10.510
don't bring shame to our Chen family.

22:10.510 --> 22:11.200
Yes.

22:11.640 --> 22:13.070
Thank you, Third Grandfather.

22:13.070 --> 22:14.200
Thank you, Uncle Junshan.

22:14.200 --> 22:15.160
Don't mention it.

22:15.160 --> 22:16.230
Miss Li,

22:16.590 --> 22:18.270
although Pan Ink has declined now,

22:18.270 --> 22:20.870
it was as famous as Li Ink
hundreds of years ago.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.440
If Li Ink needs it,

22:22.590 --> 22:24.750
I am willing to offer
the Pan family's heirloom manuscript

22:24.750 --> 22:26.920
to help you make Liuhe Ink.

22:26.920 --> 22:27.480
Good.

22:28.030 --> 22:28.830
Nice.

22:30.550 --> 22:31.270
Ruogu.

22:32.070 --> 22:32.880
Sit down.

22:32.990 --> 22:34.230
Sit down, please.

22:35.240 --> 22:38.550
Craftsmen must first sharpen their tools
to do a job perfectly.

22:38.550 --> 22:40.160
Our Xi family has nothing else

22:40.160 --> 22:42.880
but a set of stone mortar and pestle
passed down for generations.

22:42.880 --> 22:45.750
They can make the ink paste smoother,

22:46.160 --> 22:48.790
and the produced ink blacker and shinier.

22:49.070 --> 22:51.440
Just feel free to take them
if you need any.

22:52.550 --> 22:53.550
-Great.
-Nice.

22:54.960 --> 22:57.350
I'd like to express my gratitude
to you all

22:57.920 --> 22:59.350
on behalf of Li Ink.

23:01.270 --> 23:02.110
Girl,

23:02.790 --> 23:04.310
don't just get excited.

23:05.400 --> 23:08.530
For this Tribute Ink selection,
I'm giving you this one.

23:08.830 --> 23:10.030
Next time,

23:10.030 --> 23:11.640
I will definitely do my best

23:11.960 --> 23:14.160
to defeat you and your grandfather.

23:15.720 --> 23:16.550
Jinshui,

23:16.750 --> 23:19.000
dare you accept this challenge?

23:19.510 --> 23:20.370
Yes, of course.

23:24.800 --> 23:25.990
These two old pals.

23:41.880 --> 23:42.550
No.

23:43.750 --> 23:44.350
Try again.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.070
Yes.

23:54.920 --> 23:55.720
Jinshui,

23:56.510 --> 23:58.240
they can come in handy.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.880
They're valuable items.

24:29.070 --> 24:29.920
Grandfather.

24:30.920 --> 24:31.790
Third Grandfather Chen.

24:31.790 --> 24:33.390
Come and check out this soot.

24:33.640 --> 24:34.550
It's done!

24:44.160 --> 24:45.000
It's done.

24:49.090 --> 24:52.520
[Luo's Ancestral Hall]

25:02.880 --> 25:03.480
Father,

25:04.590 --> 25:05.440
Wensong,

25:06.110 --> 25:08.240
after the tragedy that struck Luo Ink,

25:08.510 --> 25:11.640
I've finally brought you guys

25:12.110 --> 25:13.640
back to the ancestral hall.

25:14.000 --> 25:16.590
Today, as Luo Wenqian,

25:17.680 --> 25:19.340
I can finally commemorate you

25:20.880 --> 25:21.960
above board.

25:34.550 --> 25:37.590
That year, Father and I
returned to Huizhou,

25:38.200 --> 25:40.880
and we paid our respects
at this ancestral hall for the first time.

25:40.880 --> 25:42.000
That day,

25:42.160 --> 25:44.440
Father kept warning Wensong and me

25:45.310 --> 25:47.640
never to ruin the reputation of Luo Ink.

25:49.110 --> 25:50.960
But fate was cruel.

25:53.000 --> 25:55.400
The one who ruined
the reputation of Luo Ink

25:55.550 --> 25:57.880
and destroyed
the Luo family's legacy...

25:58.310 --> 26:01.770
[Tablet of Hanzhang
of the Luo Family in Ming]

26:10.880 --> 26:11.480
Father,

26:13.590 --> 26:14.350
Wensong,

26:15.270 --> 26:18.330
today, I have restored
the Luo family's ancestral hall

26:19.270 --> 26:20.030
in order

26:21.240 --> 26:22.790
to start anew.

26:25.070 --> 26:26.640
If you two

26:27.960 --> 26:29.640
can hear me in heaven,

26:31.720 --> 26:33.510
please help me

26:35.640 --> 26:36.880
atone

26:38.720 --> 26:39.980
for our family's sins,

26:44.270 --> 26:46.200
and please bless the Luo family

26:48.400 --> 26:50.320
to revive one day.

27:08.960 --> 27:09.750
Aunt,

27:11.160 --> 27:12.030
are you

27:13.350 --> 27:15.210
really not going in to take a look?

27:20.340 --> 27:22.600
This is the Luo family's ancestral hall.

27:24.070 --> 27:25.750
I am now Ugly Granny Li.

27:27.440 --> 27:28.700
I am not one of the Luos.

27:29.680 --> 27:31.750
Why should I enter
the Luo family's ancestral hall?

27:31.750 --> 27:33.000
But after you pass away...

27:33.000 --> 27:34.110
When I die,

27:36.480 --> 27:38.480
Doggie will handle

27:38.480 --> 27:39.720
my funeral affairs.

27:41.070 --> 27:41.960
You

27:43.110 --> 27:44.920
don't need to worry about me.

27:45.750 --> 27:47.030
I see.

27:47.640 --> 27:48.400
However,

27:49.470 --> 27:51.280
be it Luo Mengzhen in the past

27:52.590 --> 27:54.110
or today's Ugly Granny Li,

27:55.550 --> 27:57.200
you will always be my aunt.

28:02.830 --> 28:06.590
Our Luo family's ink craftsmanship
has been passed down for decades.

28:06.590 --> 28:08.030
If these techniques

28:09.070 --> 28:11.920
really fade away
with the Luo family's decline,

28:13.350 --> 28:14.680
it would be a real pity.

28:17.440 --> 28:20.070
But I know ink is your lifelong passion,
and you are

28:20.070 --> 28:23.070
the only successor of the Luo family's
craftsmanship left in the world.

28:23.070 --> 28:24.800
I have a presumptuous request.

28:27.030 --> 28:28.440
I want to revive Luo Ink.

28:31.350 --> 28:32.550
It doesn't need anything grand,

28:32.550 --> 28:34.410
nor does it need a big storefront.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.830
I just want to

28:36.480 --> 28:38.750
focus on studying ink-making with you

28:40.270 --> 28:41.310
to atone

28:42.830 --> 28:44.030
for our Luo family's

28:44.960 --> 28:46.270
past sins.

28:53.000 --> 28:54.550
Everything in the world

28:56.200 --> 28:58.130
rises and falls according to fate.

28:59.310 --> 29:00.880
Why dwell on

29:01.000 --> 29:03.460
the loss
of one family's ink-making legacy?

29:03.750 --> 29:06.280
When your father
committed such an evil deed,

29:07.270 --> 29:08.750
Luo Ink was already

29:09.920 --> 29:11.270
doomed to fall.

29:13.880 --> 29:15.310
Luo Mengzhen

29:18.960 --> 29:21.350
already died in that fire long ago.

29:22.480 --> 29:24.110
Why do you insist?

29:26.200 --> 29:29.030
I grew up seeing my father, you,

29:29.270 --> 29:30.270
and my brother

29:30.550 --> 29:33.270
focus entirely on studying
ink-making techniques.

29:33.270 --> 29:34.550
Just the thought

29:35.640 --> 29:38.170
that Luo Ink's techniques
are about to be lost

29:41.110 --> 29:43.310
makes me really sad.

29:44.400 --> 29:46.060
The techniques of ink-making

29:47.510 --> 29:49.160
are for people to use.

29:50.550 --> 29:52.410
As long as someone is still using,

29:52.880 --> 29:54.920
studying, and innovating them,

29:56.200 --> 29:57.750
the techniques of Luo Ink

29:58.270 --> 29:59.750
will never be lost.

30:02.880 --> 30:03.880
The Luo family

30:05.590 --> 30:07.270
used to hurt the Li family.

30:08.510 --> 30:09.350
Now,

30:10.240 --> 30:13.200
the Li family is having
an ink contest with the Kuroda family,

30:13.200 --> 30:17.460
bearing the responsibilities and hopes
of the entire Huizhou ink industry.

30:19.270 --> 30:20.200
These are

30:21.960 --> 30:23.760
the manuscripts and ink recipes

30:24.510 --> 30:26.920
of Luo Ink I've compiled over the years.

30:28.640 --> 30:29.720
Take them

30:30.510 --> 30:32.040
and give them to Miss Li Zhen

30:32.880 --> 30:35.200
to help the Li family in some way.

30:36.070 --> 30:39.070
This is the only way
to atone for the Luo family's sins.

30:40.590 --> 30:42.160
From now on,

30:44.440 --> 30:45.790
Luo Ink

30:47.160 --> 30:48.960
will be integrated into Li Ink.

30:49.510 --> 30:51.110
As long as Li Ink exists,

30:51.750 --> 30:52.790
Luo Ink

30:53.480 --> 30:54.880
will not disappear.

30:56.960 --> 30:59.160
These are our Luo family's ink recipes?

31:03.090 --> 31:06.700
[Collection of Luo Ink's Craftsmanship]

31:11.270 --> 31:13.870
These really are
our Luo family's ink recipes.

31:29.310 --> 31:30.680
Let me thank you

31:31.830 --> 31:33.000
on behalf of Zhen.

31:35.000 --> 31:35.920
Wenqian.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.790
Zhen is a good girl.

31:41.720 --> 31:43.480
I know you like her.

31:44.070 --> 31:45.550
But in my opinion,

31:47.110 --> 31:49.510
you two are not meant to be together.

31:50.350 --> 31:51.750
Decades ago,

31:52.550 --> 31:54.400
I was just like her,

31:54.640 --> 31:57.070
full of passion and hope.

32:01.160 --> 32:03.220
But in the end, it all came to nothing.

32:04.030 --> 32:05.160
All came to nothing.

32:08.920 --> 32:10.850
These manuscripts and ink recipes

32:11.160 --> 32:13.690
are not only my atonement
on behalf of Luo Ink,

32:14.400 --> 32:16.160
but they also carry my own wish.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.510
I want to see her

32:17.720 --> 32:19.400
go higher and further

32:20.920 --> 32:22.310
on this path

32:23.960 --> 32:25.270
of ink-making.

33:07.750 --> 33:08.680
Are you okay?

33:14.750 --> 33:15.680
You got burned?

33:16.000 --> 33:17.030
I'm fine.

33:29.910 --> 33:33.660
♪ Raindrops fall on
the moss-covered stone steps ♪

33:33.790 --> 33:34.550
No way.

33:34.090 --> 33:38.130
♪ With a bamboo knife,
you make the spring fade away ♪

33:34.640 --> 33:35.830
It's still red and swollen.

33:35.830 --> 33:37.960
Wait here. I'll get you some medicine.

33:38.440 --> 33:40.960
♪ Last year's branches are still
hanging in the window ♪

33:41.160 --> 33:47.630
♪ The tea left a stain on the sleeve ♪

33:45.550 --> 33:46.480
Use this.

33:46.830 --> 33:48.220
I've been carrying it
with me all the time.

33:48.220 --> 33:52.170
♪ The wreathing smoke
gradually dissipated ♪

33:52.200 --> 33:56.500
♪ Counting the games of our childhood ♪

33:56.770 --> 33:59.380
♪ You lower your eyes
and count the rings of the tree ♪

33:59.400 --> 34:05.030
♪ Scars meander like a stream ♪

34:10.469 --> 34:15.110
♪ The ink-black distant mountains
resemble your eyes and brows ♪

34:15.650 --> 34:20.080
♪ Amid the inky darkness,
it seems as though a galaxy is shifting ♪

34:20.280 --> 34:24.350
♪ Lend me a bit of
the courage of a piece of pine resin ♪

34:21.070 --> 34:22.150
In the past 3 years,

34:22.280 --> 34:24.480
I have already restored the rouge ink.

34:24.370 --> 34:28.639
♪ Amid the frost,
I sketch the unfinished prologue ♪

34:25.110 --> 34:26.590
When you run out of this piece,

34:26.590 --> 34:29.230
remember to go to the ink workshop
to get several new ones.

34:28.780 --> 34:33.670
♪ The hazy, distant mountains
are just like you ♪

34:29.800 --> 34:33.030
It works for both burns and cuts.

34:34.040 --> 34:38.520
♪ A winding bridge
reflected in the water pavilion ♪

34:34.320 --> 34:36.780
Then I would still not bear
to use this piece.

34:38.590 --> 34:40.110
The ink you've restored

34:39.550 --> 34:42.920
♪ If we are to part ways ♪

34:41.670 --> 34:43.130
cannot compare to this one.

34:43.130 --> 34:51.170
♪ Let the ink speak for me and say,
"Take care" ♪

34:45.110 --> 34:46.480
Because only this piece

34:48.190 --> 34:49.520
can not only heal wounds

34:50.800 --> 34:52.130
but also heal the heart.

35:23.840 --> 35:25.770
Why did you come so suddenly today?

35:33.480 --> 35:35.070
These are our Luo family's

35:36.320 --> 35:37.110
ink recipes.

35:39.590 --> 35:41.400
My aunt asked me to give them to you.

35:41.400 --> 35:42.320
Perhaps

35:42.920 --> 35:44.030
they can be of help.

35:44.600 --> 35:46.530
Granny asked you to give them to me?

35:46.590 --> 35:48.390
These are the Luo Ink's recipes!

35:51.880 --> 35:54.080
These are our Luo family's ink recipes.

35:55.030 --> 35:56.280
But my aunt said

35:57.150 --> 35:59.000
after that fire that year,

35:59.510 --> 36:01.040
Luo Mengzhen already died.

36:01.840 --> 36:03.840
Her surname is Li now.

36:06.310 --> 36:08.940
But I know little about ink-making.

36:09.110 --> 36:10.770
My ambition does not lie here.

36:12.550 --> 36:14.550
But my aunt is right about one thing.

36:15.760 --> 36:17.320
Only when

36:17.710 --> 36:18.590
Luo Ink

36:20.230 --> 36:22.030
is integrated into Li Ink one day

36:23.440 --> 36:27.590
can it be passed down for hundreds
or thousands of years.

36:31.610 --> 36:33.400
[Luo Ink's Techniques]

36:36.000 --> 36:37.530
Please thank Granny for me.

36:43.030 --> 36:44.070
My aunt also said

36:44.320 --> 36:47.510
that although she hasn't seen you much
the past few years,

36:47.510 --> 36:49.880
she knows you have been asking Doggie

36:50.320 --> 36:52.360
to secretly send her money and items.

36:52.360 --> 36:54.090
She feels very grateful to you.

36:56.590 --> 36:57.920
But she also said that

36:58.840 --> 37:00.970
she feels guilty towards the Li family

37:01.230 --> 37:03.690
and must chant sutras
for the rest of her life

37:04.880 --> 37:07.710
to pray for the Li family before Buddha.

37:11.000 --> 37:12.400
My mother, grandfather,

37:12.550 --> 37:15.030
and I
don't want to dwell on the past anymore.

37:16.360 --> 37:17.290
Just let bygones

37:18.360 --> 37:19.510
be bygones.

37:27.510 --> 37:28.670
These years...

37:31.320 --> 37:33.000
You must have had a tough time

37:34.280 --> 37:36.280
the past few years in the southwest.

37:36.840 --> 37:37.920
No.

37:38.510 --> 37:40.840
After the general amnesty,
I rejoined the army

37:40.840 --> 37:42.670
and returned to General Yu's side.

37:42.670 --> 37:44.150
He got me a job,

37:44.280 --> 37:45.610
so I've been doing okay.

37:45.920 --> 37:46.800
But you,

37:47.140 --> 37:48.120
you are amazing.

37:49.070 --> 37:52.070
You have been fully supporting
Li Ink all these years.

37:52.070 --> 37:53.400
And not just the Capital,

37:53.400 --> 37:55.670
Sichuan, Shanxi, Henan, and Lingnan

37:55.840 --> 37:57.170
all have your branches.

37:58.000 --> 37:59.600
As expected of Manager Zhen.

38:00.030 --> 38:00.960
So impressive.

38:03.030 --> 38:04.000
You know it all?

38:07.510 --> 38:08.360
I know it all.

38:10.000 --> 38:12.930
I've kept in touch with Cuiqiao
these past few years.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.650
But every time I wrote a letter,

38:16.880 --> 38:18.030
I couldn't help

38:19.320 --> 38:21.030
asking more about you.

38:25.150 --> 38:26.000
Over the past 3 years,

38:26.000 --> 38:28.130
Cuiqiao has also been helping me a lot.

38:28.230 --> 38:29.480
I guess this was

38:30.960 --> 38:32.360
also at your request.

38:40.590 --> 38:41.400
Zhen.

38:43.630 --> 38:45.560
Although I had been away for years,

38:46.920 --> 38:48.550
I was always worried about you.

38:48.550 --> 38:49.320
Wenqian,

38:50.150 --> 38:51.680
right now, I'm only focused

38:52.880 --> 38:54.710
on making Liuhe Ink perfectly.

38:57.840 --> 38:59.640
I have no time for anything else.

39:03.230 --> 39:03.960
Got it.

39:04.670 --> 39:05.360
I got it.

39:06.800 --> 39:07.440
I see.

39:13.070 --> 39:14.470
I'll go check on the glue.

39:14.880 --> 39:16.010
Can't ruin it again.

39:17.760 --> 39:18.890
I'll leave you to it.

39:52.890 --> 39:56.710
[Ink Workshop]

40:03.480 --> 40:04.810
This glue is brilliant.

40:06.570 --> 40:08.040
It's rare and amazing indeed.

40:08.040 --> 40:08.840
Grandfather,

40:09.230 --> 40:11.280
can this glue be used to blend with ink?

40:11.280 --> 40:12.480
Of course it can.

40:13.630 --> 40:14.400
Jingdong,

40:14.840 --> 40:15.710
Zhen,

40:17.230 --> 40:19.190
go invite your Third Grandfather Chen,

40:19.190 --> 40:19.920
Grandfather Qi Chun,

40:19.920 --> 40:22.030
and President Hu over here.

40:23.510 --> 40:24.800
Let's work together

40:25.070 --> 40:26.480
to make Liuhe Ink.

40:27.590 --> 40:28.510
Grandfather,

40:29.320 --> 40:31.520
I'd like to invite someone else as well.

40:37.590 --> 40:39.550
You want to invite Ugly Granny over?

40:39.550 --> 40:40.360
Yes.

40:40.860 --> 40:44.060
Yesterday, she gave me
all of Luo Ink's manuscripts.

40:44.280 --> 40:47.550
The ink-blending techniques
recorded in them truly amazed me.

40:47.550 --> 40:49.480
I heard that when she was young,

40:49.710 --> 40:51.030
be it identifying ink

40:51.110 --> 40:52.550
or ink-blending,

40:52.670 --> 40:55.800
her skills were as good as yours
and Third Grandfather Chen's.

40:55.800 --> 40:56.840
So,

40:57.030 --> 40:58.480
I want to invite her over

40:58.630 --> 41:00.280
to help our Li family.

41:00.590 --> 41:02.510
She gave Luo Ink's manuscripts

41:03.360 --> 41:04.550
t-to you?

41:04.800 --> 41:05.590
Exactly.

41:07.070 --> 41:07.920
Jingdong,

41:10.400 --> 41:11.860
it's your call whether you

41:12.440 --> 41:14.100
want to invite her over or not.

41:14.290 --> 41:15.090
Eighth Uncle,

41:15.550 --> 41:17.710
no matter how narrow-minded I am,

41:18.000 --> 41:21.510
I wouldn't let personal feelings
interfere with serious business now.

41:21.510 --> 41:22.230
Zhen,

41:22.670 --> 41:24.590
go ahead and invite her over.

41:24.840 --> 41:27.500
I'll go invite Third Master Chen
and the others.

41:29.360 --> 41:30.550
Then I'll get going.

41:32.510 --> 41:33.360
Let me go do it.

41:33.960 --> 41:35.070
You barely slept last night.

41:35.070 --> 41:36.280
Go get some rest.

41:37.360 --> 41:38.190
Master Luo.

41:41.030 --> 41:41.840
Zhen,

41:42.670 --> 41:44.440
I see he's quite strong.

41:44.880 --> 41:45.840
Would you like

41:45.840 --> 41:47.320
to stay

41:47.360 --> 41:48.030
and help me?

41:51.710 --> 41:52.510
I'm

41:52.920 --> 41:54.920
at your disposal, Eighth Master Li.

41:55.630 --> 41:56.800
Go invite her over.

42:08.320 --> 42:09.150
Follow me.

42:31.950 --> 42:32.950
Eighth Master Li,

42:33.230 --> 42:35.110
let me go get a doctor for you.

42:36.480 --> 42:37.280
Don't bother.

42:39.360 --> 42:40.800
I know my condition

42:41.170 --> 42:42.300
better than anyone.

42:44.840 --> 42:47.510
Eighth Master Li, why did you

42:47.710 --> 42:48.670
ask me to stay?

42:50.230 --> 42:51.230
Master Luo,

42:53.400 --> 42:54.960
I had you stay

42:55.710 --> 42:57.320
because I want to talk about

43:00.360 --> 43:01.760
what's between you and Zhen.
